# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

### Dependencies ###
node_modules/          # Global node_modules (if any)
frontend/node_modules/ # Frontend-specific node_modules

### Next.js ###
.next/                # Next.js build cache
out/                  # Static export output
frontend/.next/       # Frontend-specific Next.js cache
frontend/out/         # Frontend static export

### Production ###
build/                # Generic build folder
frontend/build/       # Frontend-specific build

### Debug logs ###
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

### Environment ###
.env*                 # All .env files
.env.local            # Local overrides

### Vercel ###
.vercel/

### TypeScript ###
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

### Python ###
venv/                 # Python virtual environment
__pycache__/          # Python cache
*.pyc                 # Compiled Python files

### IDE ###
.vscode/              # VSCode settings
.idea/                # JetBrains IDE settings

### System ###
.DS_Store             # macOS metadata
Thumbs.db             # Windows thumbnail cache